  <section class="mp-section mp-paper" id="qualification">
    <div class="mp-wrap mp-split">
      <div>
        <h2>What we check before booking a walkthrough</h2>
        <ul class="mp-checks">
          <li><strong>Service area and job fit.</strong> Confirm the location, property type and work your team can take on.</li>
          <li><strong>Buyer responsibility.</strong> Find out who manages the vendor, approves a walkthrough or controls the invitation to bid.</li>
          <li><strong>Need and timing.</strong> Ask about the review date, work under consideration and any requirements the buyer can share.</li>
          <li><strong>Agreed action.</strong> Confirm a meeting, site visit, bid-list introduction or dated follow-up. Give each outcome its own status.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Your estimator handles site checks and pricing. We pass along what the buyer has shared and flag open questions.</p>
      </div>
