        <h2>Give your estimator enough context to act</h2>
        <p>We record the site, work under review and who owns the decision. If the buyer directs us to a vendor portal or another estimator, we pass along those instructions.</p>
        <p>Use the <a href="/articles/facilities-services-lead-generation-playbook/">facilities services playbook</a> to map who buys at each property. If quote requests already come through your site, see how we <a href="/articles/outsourced-inbound-lead-follow-up/">follow up on inbound leads by phone</a>.</p>
